<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed lower on Tuesday in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Amex Composite index 1.12 to 643.23.</p>
<p>The average price per share was unchanged.</p>
<p>Decliners beat advancers 296 to 255.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 25,251,735 compared with 23,370,080 on Monday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EDT/2030 GMT)</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1830))</p>
